{"tool_name":"spine-classification-based-on-kernel-density-estimation","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>We propose to use a kernel density estimation (KDE) based approach for classification. This non-parametric approach intrinsically provides the likelihood of membership for each class in a principled manner. The implementation was used in Ghani2016. Any papers using this code should cite Ghani2016 accordingly. The software has been tested under Matlab R2013b.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://biii.upf.edu/node/2752\">Sample Data: Annotated two-photon images of dendritic spines</a></p>","summary":"","value":"<p>We propose to use a kernel density estimation (KDE) based approach for classification. This non-parametric approach intrinsically provides the likelihood of membership for each class in a principled manner. The implementation was used in Ghani2016. Any papers using this code should cite Ghani2016 accordingly. The software has been tested under Matlab R2013b.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"http://biii.upf.edu/node/2752\">Sample Data: Annotated two-photon images of dendritic spines</a></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-08-16T15:46:15+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-13T15:13:46+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4424,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"5821ef5e-fd8c-4085-9a03-c9124bbd19ad","url":"/taxonomy/term/4424"},{"target_id":4426,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"b8d8e1b6-6e43-4f6c-bb08-2c6fdb301794","url":"/taxonomy/term/4426"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505227370,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"M U Ghani"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4425,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid